               <msContents>
                  <summary>An image that should contain the spread 1v-2r is missing.</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i0">
                     <locus from="1v" to="12v">1v-12v</locus>
                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s23IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#2v">-2v</locus>وقد احطنا بما لديه خبرا  , ثم اتبع سببا <note>Sūrat al-kahf, verses 91-92. The image is numbered 1v.</note>
                     </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#12r">-12r</locus>قال رب لم حشرتني اعمي وقد كنت بصيرا , قال كذلك<note>Sūrat ṭāḥā, verse 125 and the first words of verse 126. The image is numbered 11r.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>18:91-20:126. The image of the first spread (fol. 1v-2r) of the text is missing. The text on fol. 2v, begins with verse 18:91. The text ends on fol. 12r with verse 20:126. The text on folio 12v has been erased, only faint traces and a triangular black double frame remains. Red circles filled with yellow as verse markers. The identification of the scribe is based on notes in ASH00276 (fol. 13r) and ASH00265 (fol. 1r).</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
